        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "8、新笔定义与老笔定义的细微差别：",
          "source": {
            "start": {
              "page": 574,
              "top": 589.2
            },
            "end": {
              "page": 574,
              "top": 606.2
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "assets/book-images/062/page-0575-Im341.jpg",
